\section{Model}
The update rule is
\begin{equation}
w_{t+1} = w_t - \eta \nabla L(w_t)
\label{eq:update}
and the per-layer gain is $g_i_j$ for each block.

\section{Results}
As shown by Equation \ref{eq:update}, training converges.
